#! rate=44118 block=64 tracks=8 end=158824
# The arpeggiator with the sequencer (engine API v3's MIDI effects): track 1
# holds a two-note chord on steps 1 and 9, which the arp in front of the
# sound plays with the keys' notes. It runs on the sequencer's clock,
# stopped (from its tempo) and playing (Start restarts it); Stop flushes it.
@0 bpm 13000;tog 0 0 48 100 55 100;slen 0 0 0 -1 160;tog 0 8 50 90 57 90;slen 0 8 8 -1 160
@22080 play
@132352 stop
